message: "If you use this notebook, please cite it as below."
title: "Brane in outgoing AdS5-Vaidya: symbolic and numerical cross-check of the junction closure"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-XX"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Martín Alonso"
    given-names: "Javier Manuel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4051-6414"
abstract: >-
  Independent verification notebook (sympy + numerical test) for the energy exchange of a Z2 FRW brane in
  outgoing AdS5-Vaidya: Einstein source, extrinsic curvature, both Israel equations, Codazzi projection and a dynamical consistency test.
  It makes no claim of novelty relative to the braneworld literature with bulk radiation.
keywords:
  - braneworld cosmology
  - Israel junction conditions
  - AdS-Vaidya
  - dark radiation
  - verification
